  <div class="embed">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="header">
        <div class="title">Can you go 13-0?</div>
        <div class="subtitle">Draft the best Delaware high school football team.</div>
        <div class="how-link" id="how-link">How it works</div>
      </div>
      <div class="layout">
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-title" id="draft-panel-title">Draft</div>
          <div class="spin-box" id="spin-box">
            <div class="school-row">
              <button class="primary" id="spin-btn">Spin</button>
              <div class="school-display" id="school-display">Spin to get a school</div>
            </div>
            <div class="spin-meta-row">
              <div class="spins-left" id="spins-left">Respins left this game: 2</div>
              <div class="sort-container">
                <label for="position-sort" class="sort-label">Sort by position:</label>
                <select id="position-sort" class="sort-select">
                  <option value="ALL">All positions</option>
                  <option value="QB">QB</option>
                  <option value="RB">RB/FB</option>
                  <option value="WR">WR</option>
                  <option value="TE">TE</option>
                  <option value="OL">OL</option>
                  <option value="DL">DL</option>
                  <option value="LB">LB</option>
                  <option value="DB">DB</option>
                  <option value="KP">K/P</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="players-list" id="players-list"></div>
          <div class="pagination" id="pagination" style="display:none;">
            <span id="page-info">Page 1</span>
            <button class="secondary" id="prev-page">Prev</button>
            <button class="secondary" id="next-page">Next</button>
          </div>
          <div class="record-display" id="record-display" style="display:none;">
            <div class="record-value" id="record-value"></div>
            <div class="record-headline" id="record-headline"></div>
            <div class="record-description" id="record-description"></div>
            <button class="share-btn" id="share-btn">Share your team</button>
          </div>
          <canvas id="share-canvas" class="share-canvas" width="1080" height="1350"></canvas>
          <img id="share-logo-img" src="data:image/png;base64," style="display:none;" alt="delawareonline logo">
        </div>
        <div class="panel">
          <div class="panel-title">Roster</div>
          <div class="roster-grid" id="roster-grid"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="share-menu-overlay" id="share-menu-overlay">
      <div class="share-menu-box">
        <div class="share-menu-header">
          <div class="share-menu-title">Share your team</div>
          <button class="share-menu-close" id="share-menu-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <img class="share-menu-preview" id="share-menu-preview" src="" alt="Your 13-0 results card">
        <div class="share-menu-list">
          <button class="share-menu-btn" id="share-native-btn" style="display:none;"><span class="icon">&#8599;</span> Share</button>
          <button class="share-menu-btn" id="share-x-btn" style="display:none;"><span class="icon">X</span> Share on X</button>
          <button class="share-menu-btn" id="share-facebook-btn" style="display:none;"><span class="icon">f</span> Share on Facebook</button>
          <button class="share-menu-btn" id="share-download-btn"><span class="icon">&#11015;</span> Download image</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="modal-overlay" id="how-modal-overlay" style="display:none;">
      <div class="modal-box">
        <div class="modal-header">
          <div class="modal-title">How it works</div>
          <button class="modal-close" id="how-modal-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-body">
          <ul class="modal-list">
            <li>Spin to get a random Delaware high school. Only schools with at least one player who fits an open roster spot will come up.</li>
            <li>Draft any listed player into the roster slot they're eligible for. (Note: FBs can fill RB or the offensive FLEX spot.)</li>
            <li>Players are listed with their position, school and graduating year.</li>
            <li>You get up to two respins for the entire game if you want a different school to choose from.</li>
            <li>Fill all 14 roster spots to see your simulated record.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

